#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">newclass/</filename> &mdash; contains header "
"and source templates from which the &appwizard; builds the according source "
"files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:174
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">subclassing/</filename> &mdash; contains "
"templates which the &appwizard; uses to set up initial class declarations/"
"definitions in the source files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">templates</filename> &mdash; contains "
"templates from which the &appwizard; sets up the default header and source "
"template files to be used by the &nfwizard;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:176
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>configuration</filename> &mdash; dummy template to add macros."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:177 app-files.docbook:258
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevcppsupport.rc</filename> &mdash; provides the "
"<guimenuitem>Complete Text</guimenuitem> and <guimenuitem>Make Member</"
"guimenuitem> entries fo the <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> menu, the "
"<guimenuitem>Switch Header/Implementation</guimenuitem> entry for the "
"<guimenu>View</guimenu> menu, and the <guimenuitem>New Class</guimenuitem> "
"entry for the <guimenu>Project</guimenu> menu as well as a <guiicon>New "
"Class</guiicon> icon for the <guilabel>Browser Toolbar</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevfortransupport/</filename> &mdash; "
"provides entries in the <guimenu>Build</guimenu> menu needed to develop "
"Fortran applications."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevhaskellsupport/</filename> &mdash; "
"provides entries in the <guimenu>Build</guimenu> menu and according tool bar "
"icons needed to develop Haskell applications."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevjavasupport/</filename> &mdash; contains "
"the UI definition needed to develop &Java; applications."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:183
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevpascalsupport/</filename> &mdash; contains "
"the UI definition needed to develop Pascal applications."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevperlsupport/</filename> &mdash; provides "
"<guimenu>Project</guimenu> and <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu entries needed "
"to develop Perl scripts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevphpsupport/</filename> &mdash; contains UI "
"and PHP function definition files needed to develop PHP scripts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevpythonsupport/</filename> &mdash; provides "
"<guimenu>Build</guimenu> and <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu entries and "
"according tool bar icons needed to develop Python scripts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:187
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevrubysupport/</filename> &mdash; provides "
"<guimenu>Build</guimenu> menu entries and according tool bar icons needed to "
"develop Ruby scripts."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevscriptproject/</filename> &mdash; provides "
"th UI definitions needed to develop custom projects. Currently (version "
"3.1.0) unused."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:189
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevsqlsupport/</filename> &mdash; provides th "
"UI definitions needed to develop SQL projects. Currently (version 3.1.0) "
"unused."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: app-files.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid "User Oriented Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All information about user defined settings is kept in two subdirectories of "
"<filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEHOME</envar></filename>, namely:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: app-files.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"app-files-user-apps\">Application Specific Configuration</"
"link> in the <filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/share/"
"apps/</filename> directory, and"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: app-files.docbook:207
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<link linkend=\"app-files-user-config\">Resource Configuration File</link> "
"in the <filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/share/config/</"
"filename> directory."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: app-files.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "Application Specific Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:214
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Any user changes to the <link linkend=\"app-files-default\">&kdevelop; "
"Default Configuration</link> settings as well as user specific settings "
"which are not kept in any of the <link linkend=\"app-files-user-config"
"\">Resource Configuration Files</link> are found in <filename>kdev...</"
"filename> subdirectories of the <filename class=\"directory\">"
"$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/share/apps/</filename> directory."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:217
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most of these configuration files are however used by various &kdevelop; "
"plugins in order to provide some specific menu and/or toolbar entries. Thus "
"they are of interest only in case something went really wrong with the user "
"interface."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:220
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In case the contents of these directories mirror those of the Default "
"Configuration settings, &kdevelop; will have copied them from <filename "
"class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEDIR</envar>/apps/</filename> into the "
"<filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/apps/</filename> "
"directory on its initial start. Any subsequent changes will be made to these "
"copies only. The Default Configuration settings remain unchanged in any case."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:228
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">sources/</filename> &mdash; currently empty; "
"&kdevelop; uses the <link linkend=\"app-files-default-abbrev\">default "
"keyword definition</link> files for <guilabel>Expand Text</guilabel> "
"commands."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:229
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">templates/</filename> &mdash; contains the "
"user modified template definition files used by the <guilabel>Expand "
"Abbreviation</guilabel> command."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevappwizard/</filename> &mdash; only "
"provides the <guimenuitem>New Project...</guimenuitem> and "
"<guimenuitem>Import Existing Project...</guimenuitem> entries in the "
"<guimenu>Projects</guimenu> menu. The &appwizard; will use the <link linkend="
"\"app-files-default-appwizard\">default configuration settings</link> for "
"its actual works."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevastyle/</filename> &mdash; provides the "
"actual <guimenuitem>Reformat Source</guimenuitem> entry in the "
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevautoproject/</filename> &mdash; provides "
"the actual entries in the <guimenu>Build</guimenu> menu and the "
"<guilabel>Build Toolbar (KDevelop)</guilabel> toolbar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:243
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevclassview/</filename> &mdash; provides the "
"<guimenuitem>Class Inheritance Diagram</guimenuitem> entry in the "
"<guimenu>Project</guimenu> menu and the class browser combo box in the "
"<guilabel>Browser Toolbar</guilabel> by the <guilabel>Class View</guilabel> "
"project plugin."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevcloser/</filename> &mdash; provides the "
"<guimenuitem>Close Selected Windows...</guimenuitem> entry in the "
"<guimenu>Windows</guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevcppsupport/</filename> &mdash; holds the "
"acual configuration used by the &appwizard; to build C++ applications. The "
"&appwizard; however uses its main bulk of configuration information directly "
"from the <link linkend=\"app-files-default-apps-lang-cpp\">default "
"configuration directory</link>. See there for more detail."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">newclass/</filename> &mdash; contains the "
"actual header and source templates from which the &appwizard; builds the "
"according source files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">pcs/</filename> &mdash; contains database "
"files &kdevelop; uses build the actual Persistent Code Store (<filename>."
"pcs</filename>) file of a &kde; C++ project."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevdocumentation/</filename> &mdash; contains "
"the actual files used by the <guilabel>Documentation</guilabel> plugin in "
"addition to the <link linkend=\"app-files-default-kdevdoc\"> default "
"configuration files</link>. See there for more detail."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:273
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The directories in <filename class=\"directory\">kdevdocumentation/</"
"filename> mainly hold actual bookkeeping information. The actually set up "
"documentation files are kept in <link linkend=\"app-files-user-config-doc\"> "
"<quote><filename>doc...pluginrc</filename></quote> files</link> in the "
"<filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/share/config/</"
"filename> directory."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">bookmarks/</filename> &mdash; maintains the "
"entries in the <guilabel>Bookmarks</guilabel> tab of the &kdevelop; "
"<guilabel>Documentation</guilabel> plugin."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:279
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">index/</filename> &mdash; holds various cache "
"files &kdevelop; uses to speed up indexed documentation searches in the "
"<guilabel>Index</guilabel> tab of the <guilabel>Documentation</guilabel> "
"plugin."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">search/</filename> &mdash; contains files used "
"by the <application>htdig</application> search tool which serves search "
"calls from the <guilabel>Search</guilabel> tab of the "
"<guilabel>Documentation</guilabel> plugin."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevelop/</filename> &mdash; contains some "
"actual settings &kdevelop; uses for its basic setup:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:295
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">profiles/</filename> &mdash; provides actual "
"plugin profile setting. (Initially there is only a <filename>FullIDE</"
"filename> profile which defines a full set of initially active &kdevelop; "
"plugins.)"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">file-templates/</filename> &mdash; provides "
"the actually used text contents to be put into the new source file of a "
"given type. More file templates are found in the <link linkend=\"app-files-"
"default-filecreate\">default configuration files</link> directory."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:332
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename class=\"directory\">kdevtipofday/</filename> &mdash;provides the "
"<guimenuitem>Tip of the Day</guimenuitem> entry in the <guimenu>Help</"
"guimenu> menu. The HTML-File containing the available tips is provided as a "
"<link linkend=\"app-files-default-tips\">default configuration file</link> "
"only."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: app-files.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid "Resource Configuration Files"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:347
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are two groups of &kdevelop; configuration files in the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/share/config/</filename> "
"directory, distiguished by their surrounding character sequences:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: app-files.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<quote><filename>doc...pluginrc</filename></quote> denotes <link linkend="
"\"app-files-user-config-doc\">files used by the documentation plugin.</link>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: app-files.docbook:351
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<quote><filename>kdev...rc</filename></quote> denotes configuration <link "
"linkend=\"app-files-user-config-kdev\">files used by &kdevelop;</link> "
"itself and its available plugins."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:358
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevabbrevrc</filename> &mdash; holds the current state of the "
"<guilabel>Abbreviations</guilabel> configuration provided by the "
"<guilabel>Abbreviation Expansion</guilabel> plugin."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This only records whether the abbreviations will be used or not. The actual "
"definitions of new abbreviations will go into the <filename>$<envar>KDEHOME</"
"envar>/share/apps/kdevabbrev/templates/templates</filename> file."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:362
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevassistantrc</filename> &mdash; holds some configuration states "
"specific of the stand-alone &kdevelop; Assistant documentation browser."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:363
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most common configuration settings are shared with the &kdevelop; IDE "
"<filename>kdeveloprc</filename> file."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:365
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevassistantuimode4rc</filename> &mdash; holds the current MDI "
"configuration states (dock positions &etc;) of the stand-alone &kdevelop; "
"Assistant documentation browser."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:367
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevclassviewrc</filename> &mdash; holds the <guilabel>View Mode</"
"guilabel> setting of the <guilabel>Classes</guilabel> class browser tab "
"provided by the <guilabel>Class View</guilabel> project plugin."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:368
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a global setting, although the <guilabel>Class View</guilabel> "
"plugin may be disabled on a per project basis. Any change in this setting "
"will be globally updated whenever the current project is closed and thus "
"affect all subsequently loaded projects."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:370
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevcppsupportrc</filename> &mdash; holds some settings used to "
"set up CPP source files. In particular you will find the settings made on "
"the <guilabel>C++ Class Generator</guilabel> configuration dialog in here."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:371
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevdocumentationrc</filename> &mdash; holds actual settings the "
"<guilabel>Documentation</guilabel> plugin uses."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:372
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdeveloprc</filename> &mdash; holds the global settings the "
"&kdevelop; IDE and the &kdevelop; Assistant stand-alone documentation "
"browser will use."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:373
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevelopuimode4rc</filename> &mdash; holds the current MDI "
"configuration states (dock positions &etc;) of the &kdevelop; IDE."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:374
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevfileselectorrc</filename> &mdash; holds actual settings the "
"<guilabel>File Selector</guilabel> plugin uses."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:375
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevfileviewrc</filename> &mdash; holds the actual filename color "
"settings the <guilabel>CVS Integration (Cervisia)</guilabel> project plugin "
"uses for display."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:376
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevfilterrc</filename> &mdash; holds actual settings the "
"<guilabel>Shell Filtering and Insertion</guilabel> plugin uses."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:377
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevgrepviewrc</filename> &mdash; holds actual settings the "
"<guilabel>Grep Frontend</guilabel> plugin uses."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:378
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevsnippetrc</filename> &mdash; holds actual settings the "
"<guilabel>Code Snippets</guilabel> plugin uses."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:379
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>kdevtoolsrc</filename> &mdash; holds actual settings the "
"<guilabel>Tools Menu Addition</guilabel> plugin uses."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: app-files.docbook:383
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration Files Used by the Documentation Plugin"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:384
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>docchmpluginrc</filename> &mdash; holds information about the "
"actual &Microsoft; CHM help files as defined on the <guilabel>CHM "
"Documentation Collection</guilabel> configuration page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:385
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>doccustompluginrc</filename> &mdash; holds information about any "
"custom documentation file defined on the <guilabel>Custom Documentation "
"Collection</guilabel> configuration page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:386
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>docdevhelppluginrc</filename> &mdash; holds information about the "
"actual GNOME 2 DevHelp documentation files as defined on the "
"<guilabel>Devhelp Documentation Collection</guilabel> configuration page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>docdoxygenpluginrc</filename> &mdash; holds information about the "
"actual Doxygen generated API documentations as defined on the "
"<guilabel>Doxygen Documentation Collection</guilabel> configuration page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:388
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>dockdevtocpluginrc</filename> &mdash; holds information about the "
"actual KDevelopTOC structured documentation files as defined on the "
"<guilabel>KDevelopTOC Documentation Collection</guilabel> configuration page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>docqtpluginrc</filename> &mdash; holds information about the QT "
"documentation files actually included on the <guilabel> Documentation "
"Collection</guilabel>Qt configuration page."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: app-files.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid "Project Dependent Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:401
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most project dependend configuration is kept in the <filename>&lt;project-"
"name&gt;.kdevelop</filename> and <filename>&lt;project-name&gt;.kdevses</"
"filename> &kdevelop; project configuration files rather than in separate "
"files as the other, more global, configuration settings. In short, those "
"files are meant for:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: app-files.docbook:405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>&lt;project-name&gt;.kdevelop</filename> &mdash; global project "
"configuration information."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: member
#: app-files.docbook:406
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>&lt;project-name&gt;.kdevses</filename> &mdash; configuration "
"information needed to restore the specific behaviours of the running session."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:408
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Both are &XML; coded files. They can be viewed and (cautiously) altered "
"using any text editor."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: app-files.docbook:413
#, no-c-format
msgid "Persistent Code Store Files"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:415
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There is a third project dependend configuration file, the <filename>&lt;"
"project-name&gt;.kdevelop.pcs</filename> Persistant Code Store. This is a "
"binary coded file holding an internal parser cache for the most part in "
"order to speed up the loading sequence of the project. Additionally, this "
"Persistant Code Store keeps information use by the <guilabel>Code "
"Completion</guilabel> facility of &kdevelop;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: app-files.docbook:418
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There can be additional Persistant Code Store files be set up on the "
"<guilabel>Code Completion</guilabel> tab of the <guilabel>C++ Specific</"
"guilabel> project configuration page. Information about these additional "
"<filename>.pcs</filename> is kept globally in the <filename class=\"directory"
"\">$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>/share/apps/kdevcppsupport/pcs/</filename> "
"directory."
msgstr ""
